Package: rocm{{ROCM_MINOR}}
Title: ROCm {{ROCM_MINOR}} Toolkit Libraries
Version: {{PKG_VERSION}}
Authors@R:
    person("Daniel", "Falbel", , "daniel@posit.co", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides ROCm {{ROCM_MINOR}} native libraries (HIP runtime, HSA,
    rocBLAS, hipBLAS, hipBLASLt, hipFFT, hipSPARSE, hipSOLVER, rocRAND,
    hipRAND, RCCL, MIOpen, device libraries, and their development headers)
    by downloading pre-built packages from repo.radeon.com at install time.
    Intended to be used as a dependency by packages that require ROCm
    {{ROCM_MINOR}}.
SystemRequirements: Linux x86_64; not supported on macOS or Windows.
Imports: stats, utils
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/mlverse/cudatoolkit
BugReports: https://github.com/mlverse/cudatoolkit/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
